flowchart LR
    Applicant[Applicant / borrower] -->|authorization and application| Lender[Lender / LOS]
    Provider[Rent, utility, cash-flow providers] -->|permissioned aggregates + provenance| Edge
    Lender -->|authenticated request + idempotency key| Edge[API edge<br/>tenant authorization, schema, rate and replay controls]

    subgraph Platform[Platform trust boundary]
      Edge --> Contract[Feature contract<br/>types, ranges, missingness, ordering, schema hash]
      Contract --> Decision[Decision service<br/>approved model + versioned threshold policy]
      Decision --> Explain[Explanation service<br/>local contributions + reason dictionary]
      Decision --> Audit[(Audit plane<br/>minimal event + integrity seal)]
      Explain --> Audit
      Audit --> Monitor[Monitoring plane<br/>outcomes, drift, calibration, subgroup metrics]
      Control[Model control plane<br/>training, validation, registry, approval, rollback] -. approved artifact .-> Decision
      Control -. metric definitions .-> Monitor
    end

    Explain -->|score, recommendation, reasons, versions| Lender
    Lender -->|final action, notice, review, appeal path| Applicant
    Monitor --> Governance[Model risk, fair lending, compliance, security, operations]
    Governance -. approval, condition, rejection, rollback .-> Control
